{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"grep -rn ':yin.k/closes\\\\|:yin.k/issued\\\\|:yin.k/gate\\\\|:yin.k/recovery' src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf > /tmp/f1b-reader-audit.txt\nsed -n '575,615p' src/cljc/yin/vm/engine.cljc\nsed -n '735,765p' src/cljc/yin/vm/engine.cljc\nsed -n '1335,1355p' src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc\nsed -n '1,50p' /tmp/f1b-npm.log\ngit diff --stat\"","aggregated_output":"\n(defn apply-mint\n  \"Apply the driver's mint of the unminted cursor cell `cell-id`: the cell\n   becomes a cursor cell seeded with the portable `position`, as the lower\n   seeds one. Performs no stream call. Refused for a cell that is not\n   unminted, and in the `:exporting` and `:ended` gates.\"\n  [state cell-id position]\n  (let [mode (vm/gate-mode state)\n        cell (get-in state [:resources cell-id])]\n    (when (contains? #{:exporting :ended} mode)\n      (fail \"Gate is closed: late mint refused\" {:yin.k/gate mode}))\n    (when-not (:yin.k/unminted cell)\n      (fail \"Not an unminted cursor cell\" {:cell-id cell-id}))\n    (assoc-in state\n              [:resources cell-id]\n              (vm/cursor-entry (:stream-id cell) position))))\n\n\n(defn apply-close\n  \"Apply the driver's resolution of the queued close `issue` on\n   `stream-id`: removes that record and nothing else. Performs no stream\n   call. Refused in the `:exporting` and `:ended` gates.\"\n  [state stream-id issue]\n  (let [mode (vm/gate-mode state)]\n    (when (contains? #{:exporting :ended} mode)\n      (fail \"Gate is closed: late close refused\" {:yin.k/gate mode}))\n    (cond-> state\n      (contains? state :yin.k/closes)\n      (update :yin.k/closes\n              (fn [closes]\n                (filterv #(not (and (= stream-id (:stream-id %))\n                                    (= issue (:yin.k/issue %))))\n                         closes))))))\n\n\n(defn- next-target\n  \"The cursor id, its cell and the stream handle a read at `cursor-ref`\n   uses; fails when the cursor's stream is gone.\"\n  [state cursor-ref]\n  (let [cursor-id (check-ref! state :stream/next :cursor-ref cursor-ref)\n        resources (:resources state)\n      (-> state'\n          (update :wait-set (fn [ws] (filterv #(not= entry %) ws)))\n          (update :ready-queue\n                  (fnil into [])\n                  [(-> entry\n                       (dissoc :reason :op :yin.k/held)\n                       (assoc :value value))])))))\n\n\n(defn handle-close\n  \"Handle :stream/close, once the reference verifies. `close!` is total\n   over {ok} and wakes nothing: a reader parked on this stream learns of\n   the close from its own next `next`.\n\n   Under the `:running` gate nothing is performed: the close is queued as\n   a record on `:yin.k/closes` for the driver.\n   Returns {:state s'}.\"\n  [state effect]\n  (let [stream-id (check-ref! state :stream/close :stream-ref (:stream effect))]\n    (if (= :running (vm/gate-mode state))\n      (let [[n state'] (issue-number state)]\n        {:state (update state'\n                        :yin.k/closes\n                        (fnil conj [])\n                        {:stream-id stream-id, :yin.k/issue n})})\n      (do (stream/close! (get (:resources state) stream-id))\n          {:state state}))))\n\n\n(def ^:private waitset-resolver\n  \"The engine's composition for `dao.stream.waitset/check`: the whole\n                  (merge data (cond-> {:yin.k/status status}\n                                (some? kind) (assoc :yin.k/kind kind))))))\n\n\n(defn- unliftable-hold\n  \"The first hold of m with no wire pending (UCF 7.4.1, 7.4.3), or nil.\"\n  [m]\n  (let [waits (:wait-set m)\n        cells (filter map? (vals (:resources m)))\n        held? #(and (map? %) (contains? % :yin.k/held))]\n    (cond\n      (some #(= :observe (:reason %)) waits) :observe\n      (or (some held? waits) (some held? cells)) :held\n      (some :yin.k/unminted cells) :unminted-cursor\n      (seq (:yin.k/closes m)) :pending-close\n      (some #(and (= :link-request (:reason %)) (not (contains? % :cursor))) waits)\n      :link-cursor-not-installed\n      :else nil)))\n\n\n(defn- stream-row!\n\nadded 69 packages in 868ms\n\n6 packages are looking for funding\n  run `npm fund` for details\n src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc  |  8 +++-\n test/yin/vm/ucf/rows_test.cljc | 86 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n 2 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
