te_text(json.dumps(results,indent=2))\nPY\nclj -M:kondo --lint src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc test/yin/vm/ucf/rows_test.cljc > /tmp/f1b-kondo.log 2>&1\ntail -10 /tmp/f1b-all-ucf.log\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
